WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.606
Which 3D object looks like a ball? Let us think carefully. Count edges and vertices

00:00:05.606 --> 00:00:10.291
or look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is sphere. Great work!

00:00:11.117 --> 00:00:16.822
Which solid looks like a tin can? Let us think carefully. Count edges and vertices or

00:00:16.822 --> 00:00:21.101
look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is cylinder. Great work!

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:27.473
Which solid has six square faces? Let us think carefully. Count edges and vertices or

00:00:27.473 --> 00:00:31.891
look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is cube. Great work!

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:37.991
Which solid has a circular base and one point? Let us think carefully. Count edges

00:00:37.991 --> 00:00:42.576
and vertices or look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is cone.

00:00:42.576 --> 00:00:43.281
Great work!
